{"seq":3,"slug":"structured-policy-enforcement","title":"策略强制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-guardrails-content-safety/output-controls/structured-policy-enforcement","wordCount":1616,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"策略强制\">策略强制</h1><p>前面几篇的护栏都是「先让模型自由生成，再在出口检查、不合格就拦」。这套「生成—检查—拒绝」的循环有个固有浪费：模型可能生成了一大段不合规的内容，全被丢弃，token 白烧，还得重试。策略强制换了个思路——与其事后检查，不如从源头约束，让模型在格式与策略上从一开始就走不出边界。这一篇讲受约束解码、Schema 强制、与策略引擎，以及它们如何与出口检查叠成纵深。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-检查范式-vs-约束范式\">核心概念：检查范式 vs 约束范式</h2><p>把出口管控分成两类，差别在干预的时机。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  subgraph 检查范式&#10;    G1[自由生成] --&gt; C1[出口检查]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|合格| OK1[放行]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|不合格| RETRY[拒绝/重试]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 约束范式&#10;    G2[受约束生成&lt;br/&gt;只能产出合法 token] --&gt; OK2[天然合规]&#10;  end\">flowchart TD\n  subgraph 检查范式\n    G1[自由生成] --&gt; C1[出口检查]\n    C1 --&gt;|合格| OK1[放行]\n    C1 --&gt;|不合格| RETRY[拒绝/重试]\n  end\n  subgraph 约束范式\n    G2[受约束生成&lt;br/&gt;只能产出合法 token] --&gt; OK2[天然合规]\n  end</pre><p><strong>检查范式</strong>事后裁决，灵活、能处理「语义合规」这类无法形式化的约束（比如「是否有害」），但浪费算力、且有漏检风险。<strong>约束范式</strong>在解码时就限制模型只能产出合法 token，对「结构合规」这类能形式化的约束（必须是合法 JSON、必须从枚举里选、必须匹配某语法）几乎能给出 100% 保证——因为非法 token 在采样时根本不被允许。两者不是替代，是分工：能形式化的用约束，不能形式化的用检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"受约束解码-让非法输出不可能\">受约束解码：让非法输出不可能</h2><p>受约束解码（constrained decoding）的原理是在每一步采样时，根据一套语法（grammar）把不符合规则的 token 的概率强制置零，模型只能在合法 token 里选。这意味着输出<strong>必然</strong>符合语法——不是「大概率符合」，是「不可能不符合」。</p>\n<p>最常见的应用是强制合法 JSON：给定一个 JSON Schema，把它编译成一套状态机约束，模型逐 token 生成时被约束在「当前位置语法上允许的字符」内，于是产出的永远是能解析、且字段齐全、类型正确的 JSON。这对需要把 LLM 输出喂给下游程序的场景（function calling、结构化抽取、API 编排）是刚需——下游不必再写一堆「万一模型吐了非法 JSON 怎么办」的容错。</p>\n<p>形式化地说，设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 步的原始 logits 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，语法在当前状态允许的 token 集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，受约束解码把采样分布改成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">/</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(x_t \\mid x_{&lt;t}) = \\text{softmax}(z_t)_{x_t} \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[x_t \\in A_t] \\big/ Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">/</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是指示函数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化常数。落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之外的 token 概率被归零，所以输出逐 token 都合法。代价是：约束过强会扭曲模型本来的分布，偶尔牺牲一点回答质量；且语法编译有工程成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"schema-强制与参数校验\">Schema 强制与参数校验</h2><p>受约束解码保证了「格式合法」，但还有一层「语义合法」要管——字段值是否在允许范围内、参数是否通过业务校验。这是 function calling 安全的关键：模型生成了一个合法的工具调用 JSON，不代表这个调用该被执行。一个被 <a href=\"../input-defenses/prompt-injection-defense\">提示注入</a> 劫持的 Agent 可能生成格式完美、但参数恶意的工具调用（<code>delete_user(id=&quot;*&quot;)</code>）。</p>\n<p>所以执行 rail（见 <a href=\"../foundations/guardrail-architecture\">护栏架构</a>）里要做两层校验：先用 Schema 验证结构与类型，再用业务规则验证值与权限。下表区分这两层。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>校验什么</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>拦得住的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结构层</td>\n<td>合法 JSON、字段齐全、类型对</td>\n<td>JSON Schema / 受约束解码</td>\n<td>格式错误、缺字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义层</td>\n<td>值在范围内、参数合法</td>\n<td>业务校验函数</td>\n<td>越界值、注入污染的参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限层</td>\n<td>此调用是否被授权</td>\n<td>鉴权策略 / 策略引擎</td>\n<td>越权动作（LLM06）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"策略引擎-把合规规则外置\">策略引擎：把合规规则外置</h2><p>当合规规则变多变杂（不同用户角色能调不同工具、不同地区有不同数据策略、某些动作需人工审批），把这些规则散在代码里会变成噩梦。成熟做法是引入策略引擎——把策略写成独立的、声明式的规则集（OPA/Rego 风格在传统系统里很成熟，LLM 系统里 NeMo 的 Colang 也承担类似角色），让护栏在执行动作前查询策略引擎「这个调用，这个用户，此刻，允许吗」。</p>\n<p>外置策略的好处和 <a href=\"../foundations/why-guardrails\">为何需要护栏</a> 里讲的护栏优势一脉相承：规则可热更新、可审计、与业务代码解耦。一条策略变更不必改代码、不必重新部署模型，改规则文件即可，每次裁决都留痕可追溯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与检查范式叠成纵深\">与检查范式叠成纵深</h2><p>策略强制不取代前面的内容审核与事实校验，而是和它们叠成完整的出口纵深。一次输出离开模型，理想的串联是：受约束解码保证格式合法 → Schema/参数校验保证结构与值合规 → 策略引擎裁决动作权限 → <a href=\"content-moderation\">内容审核</a> 判是否有害 → <a href=\"hallucination-grounding\">幻觉与事实校验</a> 判是否属实。前两道是约束范式（便宜、确定），后两道是检查范式（处理语义）。能用约束兜住的就别留给检查，因为约束是确定性的、零漏检，而检查是概率性的。把可形式化的约束尽量前移到解码阶段，是降低整体漏检率和成本的关键设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>出口管控有两种范式：检查（事后裁决，灵活但浪费且有漏检）与约束（解码时限制，对可形式化的结构约束给确定性保证）；二者分工而非替代。</li>\n<li>受约束解码在采样时把非法 token 概率归零，使输出必然合法（如强制合法 JSON），是 function calling 与结构化抽取的刚需，代价是可能轻微扭曲分布。</li>\n<li>function calling 安全需三层校验：结构层（Schema）、语义层（业务校验值）、权限层（策略引擎裁决授权），挡住格式错误、注入污染的参数、与越权动作。</li>\n<li>策略引擎把合规规则外置为声明式规则集，可热更新、可审计、解耦；与内容审核、事实校验叠成出口纵深，可形式化的约束尽量前移到解码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：本篇约束格式与合规，与判有害的 <a href=\"content-moderation\">内容审核</a>、判属实的 <a href=\"hallucination-grounding\">幻觉与事实校验</a> 串成出口纵深；参数被污染的来源见 <a href=\"../input-defenses/prompt-injection-defense\">提示注入防御</a>；执行 rail 落点见 <a href=\"../foundations/guardrail-architecture\">护栏架构</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：约束输出的可靠性如何被回归测试覆盖，见 <a href=\"../../ai-evaluation-redteam/post-launch-evaluation/regression-protection\">回归保护</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"策略强制","id":"策略强制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：检查范式 vs 约束范式","id":"核心概念-检查范式-vs-约束范式"},{"level":2,"text":"受约束解码：让非法输出不可能","id":"受约束解码-让非法输出不可能"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 强制与参数校验","id":"schema-强制与参数校验"},{"level":2,"text":"策略引擎：把合规规则外置","id":"策略引擎-把合规规则外置"},{"level":2,"text":"与检查范式叠成纵深","id":"与检查范式叠成纵深"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"幻觉与事实校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-guardrails-content-safety/output-controls/hallucination-grounding"},"next":{"title":"护栏框架 NeMo/Guardrails AI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-guardrails-content-safety/practice/guardrail-frameworks"}}